 FontWeight->"Bold",
 FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}]], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9769387906281757`*^9, 3.976938797083085*^9}, {
  3.976948478738896*^9, 
  3.976948491333391*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"14e6aa85-3794-4c3e-b70d-\
415887386620"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "From the Wolfram ",
 StyleBox["Quantum Framework",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " help page,\nhere\[CloseCurlyQuote]s the predefined operator \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["Braid", "Input"],
 "\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] on ",
 StyleBox["two qubits",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ":\n(recall the relation to spin is 0 = up, 1 = down). "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.976894444112924*^9, 3.976894466635457*^9}, {
